(function() {
    'use strict';

    class SaltoDigitalAdapter extends USF.SimulationAdapter {
        constructor() {
            super();
            this.name = 'El Salto Digital';
            this.version = '1.1.0';

            this.CORRECT_MATURITY = { cx: 3, op: 4, bm: 2, co: 7 };

            this.INITIATIVE_ANSWERS = {
                ini1: 'digitalization',
                ini2: 'digitalization',
                ini3: 'transformation',
                ini4: 'digitalization',
                ini5: 'transformation',
                ini6: 'digitization',
                ini7: 'transformation',
                ini8: 'digitization'
            };

            this.ROUND_TITLES_EN = [
                'The Digital Diagnosis',
                'Build, Buy, or Partner',
                'Organizational Resistance',
                'The Future Business Model'
            ];

            this.ROUND_TITLES_ES = [
                'El Diagnóstico Digital',
                'Construir, Comprar o Asociarse',
                'La Resistencia Organizacional',
                'El Modelo de Negocio del Futuro'
            ];

            this.BRIEFINGS_EN = [
                '<strong>Round 1 — The Digital Diagnosis</strong><br><br>Industrias Maipú S.A. — a 65-year-old Argentine industrial manufacturer — faces a digital disruption threat. GDFLO (Germany) has captured 18% of the Argentine market with its IoT predictive maintenance platform and outcome-based contracts. Your three largest clients (YPF, Tecpetrol, Minera Alumbrera) have started pilots with GDFLO.<br><br>As the executive team, you must: (1) assess the digital maturity of Maipú using the Westerman/Bonnet/McAfee framework, (2) classify the 8 current digital initiatives into digitization, digitalization, or transformation, and (3) choose a strategic response to GDFLO.',
                '<strong>Round 2 — Build, Buy, or Partner</strong><br><br>Based on the strategic response chosen in Round 1, Maipú needs to acquire 3 digital capabilities: IoT sensors, an analytics platform, and an outcome-based pricing model. For each capability, decide whether to Build (internal development), Buy (acquire a company), or Partner (alliance with a tech provider).<br><br>Complication: The BCRA (Argentine Central Bank) has just reduced the dollar quota for technology imports. This directly impacts the feasibility of importing IoT hardware.',
                '<strong>Round 3 — Organizational Resistance</strong><br><br>The CDO has presented the Digital Transformation Plan. Three powerful resistance points have surfaced simultaneously from key stakeholders: the VP of Sales fears commission loss, the VP of Engineering fears data transparency exposing product flaws, and 47 regional distributors fear disintermediation.<br><br>Each resistance is legitimate. Your responses will determine whether the organization can execute the transformation or whether internal friction kills it.',
                '<strong>Round 4 — The Future Business Model</strong><br><br>The final strategic decision: how fast should Maipú transition from product sales (sell equipment) to outcome-based revenue (subscription / pay-per-performance uptime contracts)?<br><br>The J-curve effect: short-term revenue declines as the model shifts, before recurring revenue builds up. The speed of transition must balance competitive urgency, financial capacity, and organizational readiness from your previous decisions.'
            ];

            this.BRIEFINGS_ES = [
                '<strong>Ronda 1 — El Diagnóstico Digital</strong><br><br>Industrias Maipú S.A. — un fabricante industrial argentino de 65 años — enfrenta una amenaza de disrupción digital. GDFLO (Alemania) ha capturado el 18% del mercado argentino con su plataforma IoT de mantenimiento predictivo y contratos basados en resultados. Sus tres clientes más grandes (YPF, Tecpetrol, Minera Alumbrera) han iniciado pilotos con GDFLO.<br><br>Como equipo ejecutivo, deben: (1) evaluar la madurez digital de Maipú usando el framework de Westerman/Bonnet/McAfee, (2) clasificar las 8 iniciativas digitales actuales en digitalización, digitalización de procesos o transformación, y (3) elegir una respuesta estratégica ante GDFLO.',
                '<strong>Ronda 2 — Construir, Comprar o Asociarse</strong><br><br>Basándose en la respuesta estratégica elegida en la Ronda 1, Maipú necesita adquirir 3 capacidades digitales: sensores IoT, una plataforma de analytics y un modelo de precios basado en resultados. Para cada capacidad, decidan si Construir (desarrollo interno), Comprar (adquirir una empresa) o Asociarse (alianza con un proveedor tecnológico).<br><br>Complicación: El BCRA ha reducido la cuota de dólares para importación de tecnología. Esto impacta directamente la viabilidad de importar hardware IoT.',
                '<strong>Ronda 3 — La Resistencia Organizacional</strong><br><br>El CDO ha presentado el Plan de Transformación Digital. Tres puntos de resistencia poderosos han surgido simultáneamente de stakeholders clave: el VP de Ventas teme la pérdida de comisiones, la VP de Ingeniería teme que la transparencia de datos exponga fallas de producto, y 47 distribuidores regionales temen la desintermediación.<br><br>Cada resistencia es legítima. Sus respuestas determinarán si la organización puede ejecutar la transformación o si la fricción interna la mata.',
                '<strong>Ronda 4 — El Modelo de Negocio del Futuro</strong><br><br>La decisión estratégica final: ¿a qué velocidad debe Maipú transicionar de ventas de producto (vender equipos) a ingresos basados en resultados (suscripción / contratos de uptime pay-per-performance)?<br><br>El efecto de curva J: los ingresos caen a corto plazo mientras el modelo cambia, antes de que los ingresos recurrentes se acumulen. La velocidad de la transición debe equilibrar la urgencia competitiva, la capacidad financiera y la preparación organizacional de sus decisiones anteriores.'
            ];

            this.EVENTS = [
                {
                    round: 2, prob: 0.35, id: 'ypf_tender',
                    en: 'YPF has announced a competitive tender for an "integrated predictive maintenance provider for fluid systems" — Maipú has 60 days to respond. Can you deliver an MVP of the platform in time? This accelerates your Build/Buy/Partner decision urgency.',
                    es: 'YPF ha anunciado una licitación para "proveedor integrado de mantenimiento predictivo de fluidos" — Maipú tiene 60 días para responder. ¿Pueden entregar un MVP de la plataforma a tiempo? Esto acelera la urgencia de la decisión Build/Buy/Partner.'
                },
                {
                    round: 2, prob: 0.30, id: 'fontar_credits',
                    en: 'The Argentine government announces tax credits for industrial companies investing in IoT and digitalization (FONTAR/MINCyT). This could reduce the net capex of the digital program by 25%. Does this change any Build/Buy/Partner decision?',
                    es: 'El Gobierno argentino anuncia créditos fiscales para empresas industriales que inviertan en IoT y digitalización (FONTAR/MINCyT). Esto podría reducir el capex neto del programa digital un 25%. ¿Cambia alguna decisión de Build/Buy/Partner?'
                },
                {
                    round: 3, prob: 0.20, id: 'cdo_offer',
                    en: 'CDO Tomás Urrutia has received a job offer from MercadoLibre Tecnología at double his current salary. The architect of the digital transformation may leave. What does the CEO do to retain the critical digital talent?',
                    es: 'El CDO Tomás Urrutia ha recibido una oferta de trabajo de MercadoLibre Tecnología al doble de su salario actual. El arquitecto de la transformación digital podría irse. ¿Qué hace el CEO para retener al talento digital crítico?'
                },
                {
                    round: 4, prob: 0.25, id: 'gdflo_failure',
                    en: 'An article in El Cronista reveals that GDFLO suffered a massive platform failure at a European client — 48 hours of downtime. Maipú clients are calling to ask about reliability. How do you use this to position Maipú without directly attacking GDFLO?',
                    es: 'Un artículo en El Cronista revela que GDFLO sufrió una falla masiva de plataforma en un cliente europeo — 48 horas de downtime. Los clientes de Maipú llaman para preguntar. ¿Cómo aprovechan esto para posicionar a Maipú sin atacar directamente a GDFLO?'
                }
            ];
        }

        initialize(state) {
            if (!state.domainState || Object.keys(state.domainState).length === 0) {
                state.domainState = {
                    revenue: 48.0,
                    ebitda: 8.1,
                    digitalScore: 0,
                    stakeholderAlignment: 0,
                    compositeScore: 0,
                    maturityQuadrant: '',
                    initiativeScore: 0,
                    strategyScore: 0,
                    capabilityScore: 0,
                    bcraScore: 0,
                    salesAlignScore: 0,
                    engAlignScore: 0,
                    distAlignScore: 0,
                    transitionScore: 0,
                    scoreHistory: [],
                    revenueHistory: [],
                    activeEvents: [],
                    r1MaturityScores: null,
                    r1Strategy: '',
                    r2Capabilities: null,
                    r3Alignment: 0
                };
            }
            if (!state.decisions || Object.keys(state.decisions).length === 0) {
                state.decisions = {};
            }
            this._setupSliderListeners();
            this._updateBriefing(state);
        }

        _setupSliderListeners() {
            var sliders = ['matCX', 'matOP', 'matBM', 'matCO'];
            sliders.forEach(function(sid) {
                var el = document.getElementById(sid);
                var valEl = document.getElementById(sid + 'Val');
                if (el && valEl) {
                    el.addEventListener('input', function() {
                        valEl.textContent = el.value;
                    });
                }
            });
        }

        _updateBriefing(state) {
            var period = Math.min((state.currentPeriod || 1), 4);
            var idx = period - 1;

            var lang = 'en';
            try { lang = window.mySimulation.currentLanguage || 'en'; } catch(e) {}

            var briefEl = document.getElementById('briefingText');
            if (briefEl) {
                var briefings = lang === 'es' ? this.BRIEFINGS_ES : this.BRIEFINGS_EN;
                briefEl.innerHTML = briefings[idx] || '';
            }

            var titleEl = document.getElementById('roundTitle');
            if (titleEl) {
                var titles = lang === 'es' ? this.ROUND_TITLES_ES : this.ROUND_TITLES_EN;
                titleEl.textContent = titles[idx] || '';
            }

            for (var r = 1; r <= 4; r++) {
                var panel = document.getElementById('round' + r + 'Panel');
                if (panel) panel.style.display = (r === period) ? 'block' : 'none';
            }

            var eventAlert = document.getElementById('eventAlert');
            if (eventAlert) eventAlert.style.display = 'none';

            var ds = state.domainState;
            if (ds && ds.activeEvents) {
                for (var e = 0; e < ds.activeEvents.length; e++) {
                    var evt = ds.activeEvents[e];
                    if (evt.round === period) {
                        if (eventAlert) {
                            eventAlert.style.display = 'block';
                            var eventText = document.getElementById('eventText');
                            if (eventText) eventText.innerHTML = lang === 'es' ? evt.es : evt.en;
                        }
                        break;
                    }
                }
            }
        }

        validateDecisions(decisions) {
            var period = window.mySimulation.state.currentPeriod;
            this._updateBriefing(window.mySimulation.state);

            if (period === 1) {
                var matCX = document.getElementById('matCX');
                var matOP = document.getElementById('matOP');
                var matBM = document.getElementById('matBM');
                var matCO = document.getElementById('matCO');
                if (matCX) decisions.matCX = parseInt(matCX.value);
                if (matOP) decisions.matOP = parseInt(matOP.value);
                if (matBM) decisions.matBM = parseInt(matBM.value);
                if (matCO) decisions.matCO = parseInt(matCO.value);

                for (var i = 1; i <= 8; i++) {
                    var iniEl = document.getElementById('ini' + i);
                    if (iniEl) decisions['ini' + i] = iniEl.value;
                    if (!decisions['ini' + i]) {
                        window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                            window.mySimulation.t('classify_all_warning'), 'warning'
                        );
                        return false;
                    }
                }

                var stratEl = document.querySelector('input[name="strategyResponse"]:checked');
                if (!stratEl) {
                    window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                        window.mySimulation.t('select_strategy_warning'), 'warning'
                    );
                    return false;
                }
                decisions.strategyResponse = stratEl.value;
            }

            if (period === 2) {
                var capIoT = document.getElementById('capIoT');
                var capAnalytics = document.getElementById('capAnalytics');
                var capPricing = document.getElementById('capPricing');
                if (capIoT) decisions.capIoT = capIoT.value;
                if (capAnalytics) decisions.capAnalytics = capAnalytics.value;
                if (capPricing) decisions.capPricing = capPricing.value;

                if (!decisions.capIoT || !decisions.capAnalytics || !decisions.capPricing) {
                    window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                        window.mySimulation.t('select_all_capabilities_warning'), 'warning'
                    );
                    return false;
                }

                var bcraEl = document.querySelector('input[name="bcraResponse"]:checked');
                if (!bcraEl) {
                    window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                        window.mySimulation.t('select_bcra_warning'), 'warning'
                    );
                    return false;
                }
                decisions.bcraResponse = bcraEl.value;
            }

            if (period === 3) {
                var salesEl = document.querySelector('input[name="salesResponse"]:checked');
                var engEl = document.querySelector('input[name="engResponse"]:checked');
                var distEl = document.querySelector('input[name="distResponse"]:checked');

                if (!salesEl || !engEl || !distEl) {
                    window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                        window.mySimulation.t('answer_all_resistance_warning'), 'warning'
                    );
                    return false;
                }
                decisions.salesResponse = salesEl.value;
                decisions.engResponse = engEl.value;
                decisions.distResponse = distEl.value;
            }

            if (period === 4) {
                var transEl = document.querySelector('input[name="transitionSpeed"]:checked');
                if (!transEl) {
                    window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                        window.mySimulation.t('select_transition_warning'), 'warning'
                    );
                    return false;
                }
                decisions.transitionSpeed = transEl.value;
            }

            return true;
        }

        calculateResults(state) {
            var d = state.decisions;
            var ds = state.domainState;
            var period = state.currentPeriod;
            var roundScore = 0;
            var roundName = '';
            var keyDecision = '';

            this._checkRandomEvents(state);

            if (period === 1) {
                roundName = 'Digital Diagnosis';

                var matDiff = Math.abs(d.matCX - this.CORRECT_MATURITY.cx)
                    + Math.abs(d.matOP - this.CORRECT_MATURITY.op)
                    + Math.abs(d.matBM - this.CORRECT_MATURITY.bm)
                    + Math.abs(d.matCO - this.CORRECT_MATURITY.co);
                var maturityScore = Math.max(0, 100 - matDiff * 5);

                var diIntensity = ((d.matCX || 0) + (d.matOP || 0) + (d.matBM || 0)) / 3;
                var tmIntensity = (d.matCO || 0);
                var quadrant = 'Beginner';
                if (diIntensity >= 5 && tmIntensity >= 5) quadrant = 'Digirati';
                else if (diIntensity >= 5 && tmIntensity < 5) quadrant = 'Fashionista';
                else if (diIntensity < 5 && tmIntensity >= 5) quadrant = 'Conservative';
                ds.maturityQuadrant = quadrant;
                ds.r1MaturityScores = { cx: d.matCX, op: d.matOP, bm: d.matBM, co: d.matCO };

                var correctIni = 0;
                for (var i = 1; i <= 8; i++) {
                    if (d['ini' + i] === this.INITIATIVE_ANSWERS['ini' + i]) correctIni++;
                }
                ds.initiativeScore = Math.round((correctIni / 8) * 100);

                var stratScores = { a: 25, b: 75, c: 100, d: 50 };
                ds.strategyScore = stratScores[d.strategyResponse] || 0;
                ds.r1Strategy = d.strategyResponse;

                if (ds.strategyScore >= 75 && maturityScore < 40) {
                    ds.strategyScore = Math.round(ds.strategyScore * 0.7);
                }

                keyDecision = 'Strategy: ' + d.strategyResponse.toUpperCase() + ' | Quadrant: ' + quadrant;

                roundScore = Math.round(maturityScore * 0.3 + ds.initiativeScore * 0.3 + ds.strategyScore * 0.4);
                ds.digitalScore = roundScore;
            }

            if (period === 2) {
                roundName = 'Build/Buy/Partner';

                var iotScores = { buy: 100, partner: 70, build: 40 };
                var analyticsScores = { partner: 100, buy: 60, build: 40 };
                var pricingScores = { build: 100, partner: 50, buy: 30 };

                var iotScore = iotScores[d.capIoT] || 0;
                var analyticsScore = analyticsScores[d.capAnalytics] || 0;
                var pricingScore = pricingScores[d.capPricing] || 0;

                ds.capabilityScore = Math.round((iotScore + analyticsScore + pricingScore) / 3);
                ds.r2Capabilities = { iot: d.capIoT, analytics: d.capAnalytics, pricing: d.capPricing };

                var bcraScores = { a: 100, b: 40, c: 60 };
                ds.bcraScore = bcraScores[d.bcraResponse] || 0;

                if (d.capIoT === 'buy' && d.bcraResponse !== 'a') {
                    ds.capabilityScore = Math.round(ds.capabilityScore * 0.75);
                }

                var hasYpfEvent = false;
                for (var ev = 0; ev < ds.activeEvents.length; ev++) {
                    if (ds.activeEvents[ev].id === 'ypf_tender') hasYpfEvent = true;
                    if (ds.activeEvents[ev].id === 'fontar_credits') {
                        ds.capabilityScore = Math.min(100, ds.capabilityScore + 10);
                    }
                }

                keyDecision = 'IoT:' + d.capIoT + ' Analytics:' + d.capAnalytics + ' Pricing:' + d.capPricing;

                roundScore = Math.round(ds.capabilityScore * 0.7 + ds.bcraScore * 0.3);
            }

            if (period === 3) {
                roundName = 'Change Management';

                var salesScores = { a: 25, b: 100, c: 60 };
                var engScores = { a: 70, b: 40, c: 100 };
                var distScores = { a: 20, b: 70, c: 100 };

                ds.salesAlignScore = salesScores[d.salesResponse] || 0;
                ds.engAlignScore = engScores[d.engResponse] || 0;
                ds.distAlignScore = distScores[d.distResponse] || 0;

                ds.stakeholderAlignment = Math.round(
                    (ds.salesAlignScore + ds.engAlignScore + ds.distAlignScore) / 3
                );
                ds.r3Alignment = ds.stakeholderAlignment;

                keyDecision = 'Sales:' + d.salesResponse + ' Eng:' + d.engResponse + ' Dist:' + d.distResponse;

                roundScore = ds.stakeholderAlignment;
            }

            if (period === 4) {
                roundName = 'Business Model Transition';

                var alignment = ds.r3Alignment || 50;
                var transitionScores;
                if (alignment >= 80) {
                    transitionScores = { a: 100, b: 75, c: 50 };
                } else if (alignment >= 50) {
                    transitionScores = { a: 60, b: 100, c: 70 };
                } else {
                    transitionScores = { a: 30, b: 70, c: 100 };
                }
                ds.transitionScore = transitionScores[d.transitionSpeed] || 0;

                keyDecision = 'Transition: ' + d.transitionSpeed.toUpperCase();

                if (d.transitionSpeed === 'a') {
                    ds.revenue = 36.0;
                    ds.ebitda = 4.8;
                } else if (d.transitionSpeed === 'b') {
                    ds.revenue = 42.0;
                    ds.ebitda = 6.5;
                } else {
                    ds.revenue = 46.5;
                    ds.ebitda = 7.8;
                }

                roundScore = ds.transitionScore;
            }

            ds.scoreHistory.push(roundScore);
            ds.revenueHistory.push(ds.revenue);

            var capWeight = ds.capabilityScore || 0;
            var alignWeight = ds.stakeholderAlignment || 0;
            var transWeight = ds.transitionScore || 0;
            var stratWeight = ds.strategyScore || 0;
            var iniWeight = ds.initiativeScore || 0;

            ds.compositeScore = Math.round(
                capWeight * 0.25 +
                alignWeight * 0.25 +
                transWeight * 0.25 +
                stratWeight * 0.15 +
                iniWeight * 0.10
            );

            // v1.1.0 FIX: persist the composite (0-100) where the grading/reporting
            // layer reads it. results_utils.php::express_resolveDomainScore checks
            // domainState.performance.overallScore first, then top-level domainState.score.
            // ds.compositeScore alone is not read by default (no scoring_field), so the
            // instructor results panel and per-period score history came back empty.
            var _ov = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, ds.compositeScore || 0));
            ds.performance = { overallScore: _ov, grade: (_ov >= 80 ? 'Excellent' : _ov >= 60 ? 'Good' : _ov >= 40 ? 'Developing' : 'Beginner') };
            ds.score = _ov;

            var self = this;
            setTimeout(function() {
                self._updateBriefing({ currentPeriod: state.currentPeriod + 1, domainState: ds });
            }, 500);

            return {
                period: period,
                roundName: roundName,
                keyDecision: keyDecision,
                roundScore: roundScore,
                compositeScore: ds.compositeScore,
                revenue: ds.revenue,
                ebitda: ds.ebitda,
                digitalScore: ds.digitalScore,
                stakeholderAlignment: ds.stakeholderAlignment
            };
        }

        _checkRandomEvents(state) {
            var period = state.currentPeriod;
            var ds = state.domainState;
            if (!ds.activeEvents) ds.activeEvents = [];

            for (var i = 0; i < this.EVENTS.length; i++) {
                var evt = this.EVENTS[i];
                if (evt.round === period) {
                    var alreadyFired = false;
                    for (var j = 0; j < ds.activeEvents.length; j++) {
                        if (ds.activeEvents[j].id === evt.id) alreadyFired = true;
                    }
                    if (!alreadyFired && Math.random() < evt.prob) {
                        ds.activeEvents.push({
                            id: evt.id,
                            round: evt.round,
                            en: evt.en,
                            es: evt.es
                        });
                    }
                }
            }
        }

